{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage Fishing is a fast-paced arcade fishing game where every fish is a challenge \u2014 and every mistake makes you angrier. Inspired by the crazy rhythm of WarioWare, you face microgames lasting a few seconds that require quick reflexes, absurd decisions and a little luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Mr. Wormy, an angry worm in search of his girlfriend, Miss Wormy, who was captured by a mysterious fish during a regular fishing trip. Now, you will dive into the depths of the lake, facing bizarre creatures, ridiculous challenges and completely absurd situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the various microgames in each round, you will also face the lake's bosses \u2014 unique fish that require timing, patience and a pinch of rage. Defeat each one to get closer to Wormy's whereabouts and prove that worms can fight too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage Fishing mixes the chaos of microgames with a retro pixel art aesthetic, cartoonish sound and nonsense humor, creating a fast, intense and addictive experience \u2014 ideal for those who enjoy games with an arcade soul and a meme feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Game Highlights:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing microgames lasting 5 to 10 seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charismatic and furious protagonist: Mr. Earthworm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lake bosses: unique and funny challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slapstick humor, retro pixel art and fast-paced sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo system, rage mode and fish collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comical narrative with eccentric characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo (coming soon) to test your sanity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who said fishing is something to get calm?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816990?t=1756059506","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816990?t=1756059506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816990/8345e472a709d47b7109a57b8d3d00766ec79d95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756059506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816990/8345e472a709d47b7109a57b8d3d00766ec79d95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756059506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage Fishing is a fast-paced arcade fishing game where every fish is a challenge \u2014 and every mistake makes you angrier. Inspired by the crazy rhythm of WarioWare, you face microgames lasting a few seconds that require quick reflexes, absurd decisions and a little luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Mr. Wormy, an angry worm in search of his girlfriend, Miss Wormy, who was captured by a mysterious fish during a regular fishing trip. Now, you will dive into the depths of the lake, facing bizarre creatures, ridiculous challenges and completely absurd situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the various microgames in each round, you will also face the lake's bosses \u2014 unique fish that require timing, patience and a pinch of rage. Defeat each one to get closer to Wormy's whereabouts and prove that worms can fight too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage Fishing mixes the chaos of microgames with a retro pixel art aesthetic, cartoonish sound and nonsense humor, creating a fast, intense and addictive experience \u2014 ideal for those who enjoy games with an arcade soul and a meme feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Game Highlights:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing microgames lasting 5 to 10 seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charismatic and furious protagonist: Mr. Earthworm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lake bosses: unique and funny challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slapstick humor, retro pixel art and fast-paced sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo system, rage mode and fish collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comical narrative with eccentric characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo (coming soon) to test your sanity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who said fishing is something to get calm?</p>","developers":["Igor Silva"],"ext_user_account_notice":"IGOR GONCALVES RIBEIRO SILVA ","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816990/a0385ab078ae7ef8c2c84c06ae85f33e63562a4e/header.jpg?t=1756059506","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816990/1939478233/369220a4cf056183c673d9e3cb82c2d7e78d41d0/1756057239/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756059504","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816990/1939478233/369220a4cf056183c673d9e3cb82c2d7e78d41d0/1756057239/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756059504","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816990/1939478233/369220a4cf056183c673d9e3cb82c2d7e78d41d0/1756057239/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756059504","id":257188061,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188061/movie480.mp4?t=1756059504","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188061/movie_max.mp4?t=1756059504"},"name":"Gameplay trailler EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188061/23c1ab0434284f7f6035f313bc4ee8a77b82eeab/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17560595